+Generation samples a cyclic intercalate before the instance is assembled.  It
+then samples cell-disjoint half-order switch blocks and replaces each trade by
+its mate; these switches preserve the Latin property and every original
+half-order intercalate.  Finally independent Feistel permutations relabel rows,
