+        "Find an intercalate (a size-four Latin trade) and its disjoint mate.",
+        "",
+        f"All row, column, and symbol labels are integers from 0 through {q - 1},",
+        f"inclusive.  The Latin square has order q={q}=2^{inst['bits']}.  It is given",
