+        "",
+        "Map definition.  A Feistel component splits a label v as v=A*m+B with",
+        f"m={half_word}=2^{half_bits} and 0<=A,B<m.  For each displayed [a,b] round,",
+        "in the displayed order, replace (A,B) by",
+        "    (B, A XOR ((a*B+b) mod m)).",
+        "XOR is bitwise exclusive-or.  Recombine as A*m+B.  A chain applies its",
