+        "Track B: tabulate-and-index inversion of the displayed row and column "
+        "permutations solves the task in O(qr) Feistel rounds (q is the order and "
+        "r the displayed round count); at shipping q=4096, r=8, seed 271828, it "
+        "took 0.005219 seconds and 65,632 Feistel-round evaluations (about 262,528 "
+        "primitive exact operations), whereas the half-order invariant leaves 205 "
+        "primitive exact operations."
