-NOTES = r"""
-Definition 1.1 fixes Latin and partial Latin squares.  Definitions 1.2 and 1.3
-give the exact local conditions for a Latin bitrade.  Example 1.4 states the
-trade-replacement identity (L minus T) union its mate, Example 1.5 supplies the
