-of size four.  Section 2 defines B_n as the addition table modulo n.
-
-Step 0 rules out a Track A claim.  The paper proves no hard distribution for
-finding trades.  Its bundled Sage source uses DLX/exact cover to find disjoint
-mates; for intercalates, is_intercalate checks one rectangle directly and
-intercalate_homology enumerates all row/column pairs with four nested loops.
