-given an exact, compactly represented Latin square: a relabelled back-circulant
-square with a random set of disjoint intercalates switched to their mates.  It
-must return two concrete four-entry partial Latin squares, the trade and its
-disjoint mate.  `verify` evaluates the displayed quasigroup operation and checks
